@startuml
title Auth / BFF boundary

actor "Браузер менеджера" as Browser
participant "Next.js login/reset pages" as AuthPages
participant "Protected layout" as Layout
participant "Server Components\npage.tsx" as Pages
participant "Server Actions" as Actions
participant "Supabase server client" as ServerClient
participant "Supabase browser client" as BrowserClient
database "Supabase Auth" as Auth
database "Supabase Postgres\nRLS/RPC" as Db
participant "Supabase Realtime" as Realtime

Browser -> AuthPages: login/recovery/reset
AuthPages -> ServerClient: server action
ServerClient -> Auth: signIn/reset/updateUser

Browser -> Layout: protected route
Layout -> ServerClient: auth.getUser()
ServerClient -> Auth: validate cookie-backed session

Pages -> ServerClient: read page data
ServerClient -> Db: authenticated read models / RPC

Browser -> Actions: form/action invocation
Actions -> ServerClient: authenticated server client
Actions -> Db: privileged-by-RPC mutation

Browser -> BrowserClient: realtime client
BrowserClient -> Realtime: postgres_changes subscription
Db -> Realtime: WAL changes, разрешенные publication/RLS

note bottom
  BFF владеет request/session boundary.
  DB/RPC владеет business rules support и KB.
end note

@enduml
